  "notes": {
    "zh-CN": "用官方 exe 安装器 + /quiet InstallAllUsers=0，装到版本目录里，不需要管理员。刻意传 PrependPath=0：PATH 交给 devkit 的激活机制统一管理，避免安装器和 devkit 抢着写 PATH。",
    "en-US": "Official exe installer with /quiet InstallAllUsers=0 into the version directory — no admin needed. PrependPath=0 is deliberate: PATH is owned by devkit activation so the installer and devkit never fight over it."
  }
